 "chapter": {
  "number": 15,
  "introduction": null,
  "content": [
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 16,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "the hall -- Or, the court which is the judgment-hall."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 17,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "platted -- plaited."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 21,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Rufus -- It is possible that this may be the same Rufus mentioned in Romans 16:13."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 23,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "drink -- The stupefying drink usually given to those crucified."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 24,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "And when -- See note for order of events at the crucifixion, (See Scofield \"Matthew 27:33\")"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 25,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "third hour -- Cf. John 19:14. John used the Roman, Mark the Hebrew, computation of time."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 26,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "superscription -- See note, (See Scofield \"Matthew 27:37\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 37,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "gave up -- (See Scofield \"Matthew 27:50\")"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 38,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "top to -- God rent it down; it was rent from the top. Christ having made atonement and glorified God, the way into the holiest was now made manifest. Cf. Hebrews 9:8,24; 10:19-22."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 47,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "Mary -- (See Scofield \"Matthew 1:16\")"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
